e":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ごま油いいですよ","ts":"1635209969.233400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N9Gz1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"621df85e-e257-4c03-a9f3-901549f1457a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"タレといえば、先日、ハマチの漬けを作った時の残りのタレをシラスに和えたらサイコーに美味かったです。はい。","ts":"1635209967.233200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DMo7X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"699e9853-4aaa-4c65-8468-d7f26f96a7dd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"梅も微妙でした","ts":"1635209962.232700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K/D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16acd907-863f-4552-8328-0a5058685e71","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"焼肉のタレ納豆は個人的に微妙でしたね……\nうなぎのタレは試してないな","ts":"1635209951.232200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BGFQq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50b96261-1b9f-4e3e-8c02-f7bb3a64cb0a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"こんなもん買うほうが悪いといわれればそうかもしれぬ","ts":"1635209938.231700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dCG=r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70c17000-8590-4a5e-942b-2a1c9b8eff1a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"うなぎのタレ納豆を買ってうーん、となり（先月）\n焼肉のタレ納豆を買ってうーん、となった（今週）","ts":"1635209912.230600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"aruaru","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y4DSf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bb34062-db3e-445b-a220-bf6886825fb9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ラーメン発見伝(漫画)じゃないけど、砂糖で甘ければ美味しいっていう、そういう価値観がいまだに根強いのかなって考えてる。","ts":"1635209576.229000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k0d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1af9e05-5509-4d26-bae5-6a310d700f13","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとタレ系というか市販の味付けだと砂糖が多くて変に甘いっていう不満もあるな。","ts":"1635209490.228100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Apwe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa1809ad-68fc-43d3-8a9d-6f6670d275c8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"わら納豆とかの高級系もタレは入ってないことけっこうあるよね。","ts":"1635209431.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9K6R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"924fbfa5-c67f-4e1b-9f14-e841ff75eeb2","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"色々納豆試しましたが結局「おかめ納豆 極小粒」に戻ってしまう","ts":"1635209372.226700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V7A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b50f82d2-41d5-4ab0-9caf-b5ffdf643016","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"タレもからしも入ってない廉価な納豆もそういう食べ方をするには丁度いいのかな……","ts":"1635209211.225800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YmM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5fe670f-11dc-4068-add6-420ad3d2a916","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、かつおだしの入ったタレを好むなら、醤油+鰹節を混ぜるのも試してみてほしい。","ts":"1635209051.224300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bA8i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bd42c03-8b47-4aab-b9c6-8ca9456c1cc7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"かつおだし系もないわけではないけど、多分あれをうまいと思うのは若い人かなとは思う。\n\nくどくなるので、ラーメンでいうトリプルスープみたいに。","ts":"1635208948.223300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["U01D44KSY9Z","UAZ33BKV2","UGHD6GP16"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tKL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5f9b8c8-6b5c-4088-ba29-e67e5b6b23ad","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"直接そういう話でもないと思うんですが、かつおだしを売りにしてる納豆の方が好みだった","ts":"1635208930.222900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MURLr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbca9aab-9b2b-4577-aac2-62ffa0932b29","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"卵ご飯の時は付属のタレ+そのへんのめんつゆ","ts":"1635208913.222200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QpGa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77b9200e-8b2e-4cf2-a732-5bae7df27f1a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"納豆は付属のタレで泡立たない程度にさっと混ぜて、直接かっ食らう派です。(米にはかけない)","ts":"1635208886.221100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vGr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13553111-535e-4af2-80e4-8cd8401741d7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"昆布だしが効いた納豆タレは確かにちょっと微妙な気がする","ts":"1635208886.221000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BY1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c100c1c6-fb8e-4a23-a24d-0b40ce913076","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"よくいえば昆布だし、悪く言うとグルタミン酸ナトリウム","ts":"1635208840.219300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/gAQq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb59868b-c8ca-424c-a823-5fba4bc8a876","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うーん、かつお出汁とかじゃないんかな、気分次第の人なんだけど、いろいろ試してみようかな","ts":"1635208838.219200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"206t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b034343d-1213-4b75-a0f3-4e85f042cf43","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕の感覚ではぜんぜん相補的になってないよ。なんか植物性のアミノ酸を重ねる感じ。","ts":"1635208807.218500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jn010"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75c4e26b-220d-45b4-8e6c-d5a40ad3fdf3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"納豆、あまりこだわりがないので付属タレで食べてる\n納豆卵ご飯は最強","ts":"1635208806.218400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakarite","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ce9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a57c081e-0402-4ced-9ee2-20fd3a0e17ce","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"傾向として付属のタレはアミノ酸で甘くしすぎ\u0026amp;カラシは酸味利かせすぎですね。","ts":"1635208740.216500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iGAMD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e0588be-0a17-47ee-b850-03e620c88a6a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ダシ醤油、たぶん納豆のうま味と相補的な種類にはなってるとは思うけど、どうなんだろうなあ","ts":"1635208738.216300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g0u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ae6f098-ff88-44ee-923e-62cb5eda1ce7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"納豆卵ご飯はよきもの","ts":"1635208737.216200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U81LLJ340","U01HFNMNB55","UD1FQV38V","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yl+B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f44f99c-1e30-40d2-aeeb-a01c985b1c8a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"泡を楽しみたいなら卵と混ぜればよいのです…","ts":"1635208710.215000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2rm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57364a05-50d9-43ac-b947-1f51272a7655","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"混ぜたときに発生する泡もアリの人なのでそれもあるかもでした\u0026lt;付属のタレ派","ts":"1635208679.214400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8wB0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4325DAF6-3EE0-415A-9B53-949E83AE85E1","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"気分で選びますね\n好みとしては醤油の方\n付属のタレを使うと泡立っちゃうのが食感的には微妙に思う","ts":"1635208601.213400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U+J3x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8de15d30-3aaf-4ffd-a79c-a2369d436313","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"自分の好みに合わせるならそうかもですね。でも納豆自体でも違うから、極論納豆の種類(銘柄)分合うタレを探す旅に出ることになりそう感","ts":"1635208520.211400","edited":{"user":"UD1FQV38V","ts":"1635208554.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gjt2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c30b78b6-973a-48ed-8a40-f5a0ab305324","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"納豆に限らずいろんな食料品、一般受けしやすい味付けという意味では最適化されるけど、その商品の特性を活かしたにはなってない。","ts":"1635208422.209600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dwrP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"665f5575-aeab-4709-9502-3dbb9b120a2f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なんだろマス向けに合わせたタレが付いてくる。","ts":"1635208371.208700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LTM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b783e75-080d-477f-9169-33800caa64d5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや全然最適化されてないよ。","ts":"1635208356.208400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g2JA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9640ba67-4027-4063-83be-29a45905bffd","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"私は付属のタレ派です。その納豆に最適化されたタレがついてくると思ってるので(郷に入っては郷に従う的な)","ts":"1635208289.207600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xZN5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"210a8fbe-513a-44f9-ad44-14cfd5031d83","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"カラシもか。\n\n自分で用意した醤油とカラシに落ち着く。","ts":"1635207878.206300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K7UFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4758eaf-7edd-4a0b-bc64-2cf7e311b8dd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕は納豆に付属のタレ、NG派","ts":"1635207824.205700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lz4wF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e98c464e-275a-4dac-94d5-0ff7e747d7a2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"色んなタレで納豆売ってるけど、毎回オーソドックスなやつが一番だな…ってなる","ts":"1635199198.205300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VMG=7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"490ce155-f49c-4b7a-9859-45a596b05fdb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"筋引き包丁かっこいい","ts":"1635176223.203600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d3X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2bb2bd5-5b21-43b8-abee-be8c0f63e6d1","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"夫婦で3食で食べきる予定で、冷蔵です!","ts":"1635176003.202900","thread_ts":"1635143137.138000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IU/"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"22d23c52-9254-41e2-918f-f12e69538220","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"うちは残りの豚肉をまとめてローストして夕食にしました!","ts":"1635143137.138000","thread_ts":"1635143137.138000","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FqM1J"}]}}]
